# Natural cadence for copy

Before writing or revising prose a person is meant to read, read and follow `.cursor/skills/natural-cadence-editor/SKILL.md`.

That includes the README, technical docs, changelogs, release notes, UI copy, and in-code strings shown to a user. Leave code, commands, identifiers, and config unchanged.

Do not finish the draft until it passes that skill: read each sentence aloud, break stacked clauses, and remove repeated stems, echoed nouns and verbs, and accidental alliteration.
